 "bloques": [
  {
   "tipo": "explicacion",
   "titulo": "The imperative",
   "texto": [
    "To give orders or instructions, use the form of the present without pronoun. With **tu** you remove the **-s** from the verbs in **-er**: **Tu écoutes** → **Écoute !** (listen!).",
    "With **vous** and **nous** nothing is taken away: **Parlez !** (speak!), **Mangeons !** (eat!)."
   ]
  },
  {
   "tipo": "explicacion",
   "titulo": "Very used verbs",
   "texto": [
    "**Va** (ve), **allez** (id), **allons** (come on).",
    "**Sois** (know), **soyez** (thirst).",
    "**Aie** (ten), **ayez** (ten)."
   ]
  },
  {
   "tipo": "explicacion",
   "titulo": "Negative",
   "texto": [
    "**ne** and **pas** are put around the verb: **Ne parle pas !** (do not speak!), **Ne mangez pas !** (do not eat!)."
   ]
  },
